           +------------------------------------+
           | make-withdraw: ...                 |
global --->|                                    |
env        | W1: --+                            |
           +-------|----------------------------+
                   |                   ^
                   |                   |
                   |            +------+------+
                   |     E1 --->| balance: 50 |
                   |            +-------------+
                   V                   ^
               .---.---.               |
               | O | O-+---------------+
               `-|-^---'
                 |
                 V
          parameters: amount
          body: ...
@end example
@end ifinfo
